<title>UK: SocGen sets call warrants on Adecco.</title>
<headline>SocGen sets call warrants on Adecco.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale Acceptance NV has issued three million American-style call warrants, on Adecco SA bearer shares, lead manager Societe Generale Bank and Trust Zurich said.</p>
<p>20 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    500.00 CHF		PREMIUM	20.6 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.72 CHF		  GEARING	6.4 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   10.FEB.99		 PAYDATE	02.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  476.00 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  SGECHF0</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
